    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Balancing Precision and Retention in Experimental Design\"\nsubtitle: \"Additional Materials\"\nformat: \n  html:\n    page-layout: article\nnavbar: false\ntoc: true\n---\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n# Block randomization\n\n## Illustration\n\n![](precision_retention/blocking.png){fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n## Estimator\n\n$$\\widehat{ATE}_{\\text{Block}} = \\sum_{b=1}^B \\frac{n_b}{N} \\widehat{ATE}_b$$\n\n## Code\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Standard design\nlm(Y ~ Z, \n   data = data)\n\n# Block randomized\nlm(Y ~ Z + block, \n   data = data)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n# Current use\n\nBased on 2022-23 articles published in APSR, AJPS, JOP, PB, CPS, JEPS.\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- preamble start -->\n\n    <script>\n      function styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(i, j, css_id) {\n        var table = document.getElementById(\"tinytable_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd\");\n        table.rows[i].cells[j].classList.add(css_id);\n      }\n      function insertSpanRow_fyl2xybdc6k9aocxexne(i, colspan, content) {\n        var table = document.getElementById('tinytable_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd');\n        var newRow = table.insertRow(i);\n        var newCell = newRow.insertCell(0);\n        newCell.setAttribute(\"colspan\", colspan);\n        // newCell.innerText = content;\n        // this may be unsafe, but innerText does not interpret <br>\n        newCell.innerHTML = content;\n      }\n      function spanCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(i, j, rowspan, colspan) {\n        var table = document.getElementById(\"tinytable_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd\");\n        const targetRow = table.rows[i];\n        const targetCell = targetRow.cells[j];\n        for (let r = 0; r < rowspan; r++) {\n          // Only start deleting cells to the right for the first row (r == 0)\n          if (r === 0) {\n            // Delete cells to the right of the target cell in the first row\n            for (let c = colspan - 1; c > 0; c--) {\n              if (table.rows[i + r].cells[j + c]) {\n                table.rows[i + r].deleteCell(j + c);\n              }\n            }\n          }\n          // For rows below the first, delete starting from the target column\n          if (r > 0) {\n            for (let c = colspan - 1; c >= 0; c--) {\n              if (table.rows[i + r] && table.rows[i + r].cells[j]) {\n                table.rows[i + r].deleteCell(j);\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n        // Set rowspan and colspan of the target cell\n        targetCell.rowSpan = rowspan;\n        targetCell.colSpan = colspan;\n      }\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { insertSpanRow_fyl2xybdc6k9aocxexne(4, 3, 'Neither') });\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(-1, 0, 'tinytable_css_id9xv9mmz7ob57r3yyd429') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(-1, 1, 'tinytable_css_id9xv9mmz7ob57r3yyd429') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(-1, 2, 'tinytable_css_id9xv9mmz7ob57r3yyd429') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(0, 0, 'tinytable_css_id0gf094statn3lalcrh56') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(0, 1, 'tinytable_css_id0gf094statn3lalcrh56') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(0, 2, 'tinytable_css_id0gf094statn3lalcrh56') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(1, 0, 'tinytable_css_idnzbgqmjw7rmdl0w9ukth') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(1, 1, 'tinytable_css_idwz6er5dqmf9vti062104') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_oxplpde9wwecrfaujpwd(1, 2, 'tinytable_css_idwz6er5dqmf9vti062104') })\nwindow.addEventListener('load', function () { styleCell_o